{"attempt_id": "formal-backflow:2026-08-21:ID32641", "capture_schema_version": "math-fast-intake-capture-v2", "content_hash": "1feaaea99f7fa644edcb8893a884c49b87954787e1953b4a44b8e4fc135ebbb6", "episode_evidence": {"solution_text": "由 y=z 代入球面得 x^2+2y^2=1。取参数 x=cos t，y=z=(sin t)/√2，并选择与从 +z 轴看逆时针一致的 t:0→2π。代入 xyz dz 后得到常数 1/(2√2) 乘以 sin^2t cos^2t 的周期积分，利用标准三角幂积分可得 √2π/16。也可在平面 y=z 内选定向圆盘使用 Stokes，但法向与边界方向必须满足右手关系。", "teaching_turns": [{"kind": "reasoning", "origin": "user_observed", "speaker": "user", "text": "用户知道约束破坏简单轮换对称性，但不会从 y=z 与球面约束构造参数；提示后能完成椭圆参数化变式，却把原题常数系数写成 2(√2/2)，并继续追问 Stokes 的曲面、法向量和方向。"}, {"kind": "explanation", "origin": "assistant_explained", "speaker": "assistant", "text": "由 y=z 代入球面得 x^2+2y^2=1。取参数 x=cos t，y=z=(sin t)/√2，并选择与从 +z 轴看逆时针一致的 t:0→2π。代入 xyz dz 后得到常数 1/(2√2) 乘以 sin^2t cos^2t 的周期积分，利用标准三角幂积分可得 √2π/16。也可在平面 y=z 内选定向圆盘使用 Stokes，但法向与边界方向必须满足右手关系。"}], "user_answer_text": "用户知道约束破坏简单轮换对称性，但不会从 y=z 与球面约束构造参数；提示后能完成椭圆参数化变式，却把原题常数系数写成 2(√2/2)，并继续追问 Stokes 的曲面、法向量和方向。"}, "event_id": "MFI-CAP-935553342b7ea48964bc60ec", "event_type": "capture", "evidence": {"first_break": {"kind": "method_trigger", "origin": "assistant_inferred", "text": "没有先用 y=z 消元，把交线化成平面内椭圆 x^2+2y^2=1 后再参数化。"}, "hints_needed": [{"origin": "assistant_explained", "text": "提示先消去 z，再对 x^2+2y^2=1 做标准化参数化。"}, {"origin": "assistant_explained", "text": "提示用 +z 视角检查参数增大方向。"}, {"origin": "assistant_explained", "text": "完整讲解 Stokes 曲面与法向量选择。"}], "independent_correct_steps": [{"origin": "user_observed", "text": "正确判断 y=z 约束破坏球面的简单轮换对称。"}, {"origin": "user_observed", "text": "提示后能独立完成标准椭圆参数化变式。"}, {"origin": "user_observed", "text": "能理解参数增大方向需要与题目方向核对。"}], "later_breaks": [{"kind": "unknown", "origin": "assistant_inferred", "text": "代入 xyz dz 时常数系数少乘因子。"}, {"kind": "unknown", "origin": "assistant_inferred", "text": "混淆参数起点与曲线方向。"}, {"kind": "unknown", "origin": "assistant_inferred", "text": "Stokes 的曲面选择和右手关系需要完整讲解。"}], "mastery_score": 2, "mastery_source": "assistant_assessed_from_source_dialogue", "result": "wrong", "score_basis": {"origin": "assistant_inferred", "text": "局部参数化能力存在，但原题消元、系数、方向与 Stokes 主线均需多轮提示，最后无独立复现。"}, "self_corrections": [{"origin": "user_observed", "text": "提示后完成变式参数化并接受 0 到 2π 的方向说明。"}], "unresolved": [{"origin": "unresolved", "text": "未观察到无提示闭卷完整复现。"}], "user_facts": [{"origin": "user_observed", "text": "用户知道约束破坏简单轮换对称性，但不会从 y=z 与球面约束构造参数；提示后能完成椭圆参数化变式，却把原题常数系数写成 2(√2/2)，并继续追问 Stokes 的曲面、法向量和方向。"}]}, "idempotency_key": "935553342b7ea48964bc60ece6b785ca94b15996cb3f71405504ee2c5156c251", "initial_state": "pending_nightly", "payload_hash": "5837f988bbde63d6d149f5e21f796be9c7b24450216fac48557ce1fe76c06fd8", "recorded_at": "2026-08-22T22:01:10+08:00", "requested_action": "record_wrong", "schema_version": "math-fast-intake-ledger-v1", "score_ref": null, "source_bundle": {"manifest_hash": "583bf8609c62a7d9daebb61362ee9f5811eecf2e344737c887c6853614927ba2", "manifest_path": "数学一回滚复习系统/快速入库来源/2026-08-21/f5d33beec00a354c20f32b76/manifest.json", "source_locator": "T9数学错题记录:2026-08-21:ID32641", "study_date": "2026-08-21"}, "study_date": "2026-08-21", "target": {"formal_id": null, "identity_state": "source_backed", "kind": "new_source", "source_hash_before": "583bf8609c62a7d9daebb61362ee9f5811eecf2e344737c887c6853614927ba2", "source_locator": "T9数学错题记录:2026-08-21:ID32641"}, "thread_ref": null}
